  "authors": [],
  "body": {
    "comment": "Yoroi DRep votes YES on Update Constitutional Committee 2026. Yoroi recognises that a functioning Constitutional Committee is essential to the continuity of Cardano governance.\n\n- Position Update: Yoroi previously voted ABSTAIN on this proposal. At that time, we chose to withhold our vote while considering the responsibility entrusted to us by our delegators. Following further consideration, Yoroi is changing its vote to YES.\n\n- Governance Continuity: The Constitutional Committee must remain operational so that it can continue to carry out its constitutional responsibilities when needed. This proposal renews the seats whose terms are expiring and implements the outcome of the 2026 Constitutional Committee election.\n\nFor these reasons, Yoroi supports the proposal and votes YES."
  },
  "hashAlgorithm": "blake2b-256"
}